> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT * FROM a5_pht p1 JOIN a5_pht p2 USING (c) LIMIT 1
QUERY PLAN:text
Limit
  ->  Append
        ->  Nested Loop
              Join Filter: (p1_1.c = p2_1.c)
              ->  Seq Scan on a5_pht_p1 p1_1
              ->  Materialize
                    ->  Seq Scan on a5_pht_p1 p2_1
        ->  Nested Loop
              Join Filter: (p1_2.c = p2_2.c)
              ->  Seq Scan on a5_pht_p2 p1_2
              ->  Materialize
                    ->  Seq Scan on a5_pht_p2 p2_2
        ->  Nested Loop
              Join Filter: (p1_3.c = p2_3.c)
              ->  Seq Scan on a5_pht_p3 p1_3
              ->  Materialize
                    ->  Seq Scan on a5_pht_p3 p2_3
-- EXPLAIN

